            <profile id="08c6-f075-1fe7-bca9" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="af20-e256-4a51-93aa" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, thrusting spear, light armour and shield. May have double-handed axes (+3 pts). May have javelins (+2 pts). May be mounted on a horse (+8 pts). One Ealdorman may be made Army Standard Bearer (+15 pts). (Shieldwall p.23)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="8377-8887-6545-f82d" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
