              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword. May be armed with light armour (+3 pts), shield (+2 pts). May be mounted on a horse (+8 pts). A unit that the Abbod accompanies re-rolls any misses in the first round of any combat. 0-1. (Shieldwall p.23)</characteristic>
