            <profile id="60ad-9069-4bc0-132a" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="af20-e256-4a51-93aa" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapons and javelin. May exchange javelin for sling (free). May exchange javelin for bow (+1 pt). May exchange javelin for shield and thrusting spear (+1 pt). Geburs armed with javelin, sling or bow count as Skirmishers. Shield-armed Geburs have Shieldwall. No more than half the Gebur models may be bow-armed (not enforced). Anglia and Northumbria may combine spear and shield-armed Gebur with Thegns and Huscarls in the same way as Ceorls. (Shieldwall p.23)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="bda2-fb13-b780-fd5e" name="Hand Weapon" hidden="false" targetId="a423-b782-e1ce-43e2" type="profile"/>
