            <profile id="0192-6a27-3a90-2c25" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="af20-e256-4a51-93aa" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapons, javelins and shield. May have light armour (+2 pts) and throwing spear (+2 pts) or thrusting spears (+2 pts). May exchange javelins and shield for bow (free). May be mounted on a horse (+8 pts). Light Infantry. Warband. If the unit is broken it never rallies. Dogs of War cannot be accompanied by characters and cannot benefit from the Army General and Standard Bearer rules. (Shieldwall p.77)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="288a-6da6-e2f7-ae37" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">6+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
